      <div className=\"\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" className=\"h-5 w-5 text-pink-500\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n                <path fillRule=\"evenodd\"\n                  d=\"M3.172 5.172a4 4 0 015.656 0L10 6.343l1.172-1.171a4 4 0 115.656 5.656L10 17.657l-6.828-6.829a4 4 0 010-5.656z\"\n                  clipRule=\"evenodd\" />\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"bg-gray-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 hidden md\">\n              Superhost</div>\n          </div>\n          <h3 className=\"font-black text-gray-800 md3xl text-xl\">The Majestic and Wonderful Bahamas</h3>\n          <p className=\"md text-gray-500 text-base\">The best kept secret of The Bahamas is the country’s sheer\n            size and diversity. With 16 major islands, The Bahamas is an unmatched destination</p>\n          <p className=\"text-xl font-black text-gray-800\">\n            $110\n            <span className=\"font-normal text-gray-600 text-base\">/night</span>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
